{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大的罪和懲罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["猶大的罪是用鐵筆、用金鋼鑽記錄的，銘刻在他們的心版上和壇角上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他們的兒女記念他們高岡上、青翠樹旁的壇和木偶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我田野的山哪，我必因你在四境之內所犯的罪，把你的貨物、財寶，並邱壇當掠物交給仇敵；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["並且你因自己的罪必失去我所賜給你的產業。我也必使你在你所不認識的地上服事你的仇敵；因為你使我怒中起火，直燒到永遠。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["訓誨集"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠人血肉的膀臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中離棄耶和華的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那人有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他必像沙漠的杜松，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不見福樂來到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻要住曠野乾旱之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人居住的鹼地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠耶和華、以耶和華為可靠的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必像樹栽於水旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在河邊扎根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"炎熱來到，並不懼怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葉子仍必青翠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在乾旱之年毫無掛慮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且結果不止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"人心比萬物都詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壞到極處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能識透呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我－耶和華是鑒察人心、試驗人肺腑的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要照各人所行的和他做事的結果報應他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"那不按正道得財的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像鷓鴣菢不是自己下的蛋；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了中年，那財都必離開他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他終久成為愚頑人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"我們的聖所是榮耀的寶座，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從太初安置在高處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－以色列的盼望啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡離棄你的必致蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：離開我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的名字必寫在土裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們離棄我這活水的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米求耶和華幫助"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你醫治我，我便痊癒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救我，我便得救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你是我所讚美的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們對我說：耶和華的話在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫這話應驗吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於我，那跟從你作牧人的職分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我並沒有急忙離棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有想那災殃的日子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你知道的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我口中所出的言語都在你面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要使我因你驚恐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當災禍的日子，你是我的避難所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那些逼迫我的蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不要使我蒙羞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們驚惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不要使我驚惶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使災禍的日子臨到他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以加倍的毀壞毀壞他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["關於遵守安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶和華對我如此說：「你去站在平民的門口，就是猶大君王出入的門，又站在耶路撒冷的各門口，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["對他們說：『你們這猶大君王和猶大眾人，並耶路撒冷的一切居民，凡從這些門進入的都當聽耶和華的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華如此說：你們要謹慎，不要在安息日擔甚麼擔子進入耶路撒冷的各門；"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["也不要在安息日從家中擔出擔子去。無論何工都不可做，只要以安息日為聖日，正如我所吩咐你們列祖的。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["他們卻不聽從，不側耳而聽，竟硬着頸項不聽，不受教訓。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和華說：「你們若留意聽從我，在安息日不擔甚麼擔子進入這城的各門，只以安息日為聖日，在那日無論何工都不做；"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["那時就有坐大衛寶座的君王和首領，他們與猶大人，並耶路撒冷的居民，或坐車，或騎馬，進入這城的各門，而且這城必存到永遠。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["也必有人從猶大城邑和耶路撒冷四圍的各處，從便雅憫地、高原、山地，並南地而來，都帶燔祭、平安祭、素祭，和乳香，並感謝祭，到耶和華的殿去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["你們若不聽從我，不以安息日為聖日，仍在安息日擔擔子，進入耶路撒冷的各門，我必在各門中點火；這火也必燒毀耶路撒冷的宮殿，不能熄滅。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}